##STARTING AN EBOOK SELLING BUSINESS ON THREADS
NOTE – Each of the steps is explained further in the respective sections. 



Step 1 – Niche Selection 
Identify problems people are willing to pay to solve.
Explore profitable niches.
Validate demand on Threads.
Research existing ebooks and competitors.



Step 2 – Threads Account Setup 
Create a dedicated Threads account.
Set up username, display name and profile picture.
Write an optimized bio.
Add your Gumroad product link (once available).



Step 3 – Ebook Creation 
Research your selected topic.
Generate ebook title and table of contents using ChatGPT.
Create content chapter by chapter.
Review, edit and humanize AI-generated content.



Step 4 – Ebook Design and Packaging 
Design the ebook using Canva.
Create the cover page and chapter layouts.
Add images, charts and other visual elements.
Export the final ebook as a PDF.



Step 5 – Gumroad Store Setup
Create a Gumroad account.
Set up your profile and storefront.
Upload your ebook.
Set pricing and write the product description.
Configure payment and digital delivery.



Step 6 – Threads Marketing and Audience Building
Research successful creators in your niche.
Study high-performing Threads posts.
Create value-based and promotional posts.
Maintain a consistent posting schedule.
Engage with your target audience.



Step 7 – Sales and Revenue Tracking 
Direct interested followers to your Gumroad product.
Monitor product views and sales.
Track revenue, platform fees and actual profit.
Analyse performance and improve your marketing strategy.



Step 8 – Scaling Your Ebook Business
Create additional ebooks.
Introduce bundles and complementary products.
Experiment with pricing and promotional strategies.
Expand into new niches and audiences.
